Subject: [PATCH 4/4] [M156] [ir] prevent infinite loops: ensure loop increment
 survives backends

Original change's description:
> [ir] prevent infinite loops: ensure loop increment survives backends
>
> Ensure the loop counter increment always survives through
> to the backend.
>
> If the loop body ends in unreachable, replace it with
> "continue".
>
> This fixes a bug where DXC can deduce a loop has no break,
> and then errors out.
>
> FXC fails on one graphicsfuzz test case.
>
> Fixed: 582926979
